  "label": "User projected onto the person in the wizard costume via the text 'your president'",
  "description": "The bottom text 'trump is still your president' projects the user onto the person in the wizard costume by using the possessive pronoun 'your'. This implies that the political authority of Trump belongs to the user, and the person in the costume visually represents this ownership or loyalty. The costume, though absurd, is used to symbolize the user's allegiance to Trump's presidency.",
